  - Kaleidoscope cooking mods.                              
  - Create and its addons.                                  
  - Farming and crop mods.                                  
  - Animal and wildlife mods.                               
  - Fishing mods.                                           
  - Building and decoration mods.                           
  - Exploration and structure mods.                         
  - Trading and currency mods.                              
  - Enchanting and crafting mods.                           
                                                            
  Do not assume a mod is installed or compatible just       
  because it appears in the exported list.                  
                                                            
  Verify actual Forge 1.20.1 files and versions when        
  available.                                                
                                                            
  For each investigated integration, record the actual      
  classes, methods, events and evidence.                    
                                                            
  Use honest statuses such as Planned, Investigating,       
  Implemented, Unit Tested, GameTest Verified, Manually     
  Tested and Unsupported.                                   
                                                            
  ## 6. Establish technical research standards              
                                                            
  Prioritize:                                               
                                                            
  - Official Minecraft Forge 1.20.1 documentation.          
  - Relevant Forge source code.                             
  - Minecraft source and mappings.                          
  - Actual installed mod source code.                       
  - Official mod APIs and repositories.                     
                                                            
  Do not rely on outdated tutorials when source-level       
  verification is possible.                                 
                                                            
  Never invent event names, API methods, class names or     
  compatibility claims.                                     
                                                            
