  Keep important, verified project knowledge in             
  version-controlled documentation.                         
                                                            
  Do not save unverified assumptions as facts.              
                                                            
  After a significant integration or architecture change,   
  update the relevant documentation and compatibility       
  status.                                                   
                                                            
  ## 9. Git and implementation restrictions                 
                                                            
  - Do not implement new professions during this task.      
