  ⎿  Created 0008-replace-pufferfish-skills.md (+15 -0)
       1 +# ADR-0008: Lunchtime Jobs replaces Pufferfish's Skills        
       2 +                                                               
       3 +Status: Accepted · Decided by the project owner, 2026-10-31    
       4 +                                                               
       5 +**Decision.** Lunchtime Jobs will eventually replace Pufferfish
         +'s Skills (and the KubeJS career scripts that feed it) as the  
       6 +modpack's profession and job progression system. The two system
         +s will not coexist permanently. Pufferfish stays installed only
       7 +during development, until Lunchtime Jobs is complete enough to 
         +take over.                                                     
       8 +                                                               
       9 +**Constraints.**                                               
      10 +- Lunchtime Jobs owns its own progression, XP, levels, UI, conf
         +iguration, persistence and integrations. It is standalone.     
      11 +- No dependency on Pufferfish (required or optional), and no pe
         +rmanent compatibility layer or bridge to it.                   
      12 +- Pufferfish and the scripts are used only as a reference for w
         +hat the pack currently offers.                                 
      13 +                                                               
      14 +**Consequences.** Before Pufferfish can be removed, the feature
         + gaps in `docs/pufferfish-replacement-plan.md` must be closed. 
      15 +Duplicate XP during the transition is avoided by process (see t
         +hat plan), not by integration code.                            
